<title>NORWAY: Aker RGI sells stake in EDB data group.</title>
<headline>Aker RGI sells stake in EDB data group.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian holding company Aker RGI ASA said on Monday it had sold its stake in Elektronisk Databehandling ASA.</p>
<p>Aker RGI said it had sold 5.6 million shares at 12 crowns per share and would book a profit of around 38 million crowns from the sale.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
